{"id":"zasluga","lemma":"заслуга","pos":"noun","rank":4666,"glosses":["merit, desert","service"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fa/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BB%D1%83%D0%B3%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BB%D1%83%D0%B3%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"заслуги","plural":"заслуги"},"examples":[{"text":"Не преувеличивайте мои заслуги.","en":"Don't exaggerate my achievements.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Ты, видимо, хочешь все заслуги приписать себе.","en":"You seem to want to take all the credit.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"apparently, evidently"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},null,null,{"g":"myself","l":"себя"}]},{"text":"Не присваивай себе чужие заслуги.","en":"Don't take credit for somebody else's accomplishments.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"myself","l":"себя"},{"g":"someone else’s","l":"чужой"},null]},{"text":"Том признал, что организация вечеринки - заслуга Мэри.","en":"Tom admitted that it was Mary who had organized the party.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/651083","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to recognize","l":"признать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"organization"},{"g":"soirée, evening party","l":"вечеринка"},null,null]},{"text":"Вы, видимо, хотите все заслуги приписать себе.","en":"You seem to want to take all the credit.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"apparently, evidently"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},null,null,{"g":"myself","l":"себя"}]}]}